~ main
Whitney: So, I suppose you're here to check if your letter arrived?
- Yes!
	Whitney: Let me check[wait=1].[wait=1].[wait=1]. No, it's not here!
	$> GlobalVars.post_visits += 1
	- You're sure?
		Whitney: I can check again, two second[wait=2].[wait=2].[wait=2]. No, still nothing
		$> GlobalVars.post_visits += 1
		- And what about the back?
			Whitney: I can go in the back, I'll be there in a minute[wait=3].[wait=13].[wait=3]. No, still nothing
			$> GlobalVars.post_visits += 1
			- And what about the other room?
				Whitney: And what about you leave me alone!?
				if GlobalVars.post_visits >= GlobalVars.max_post_visits:
					=> bad_end
				Whitney: Now [shake rate=20 level=20] GET OUT!
				=> END
			- Okay...
		- Okay...
	- Okay...
	Whitney: What's so special about this letter anyway?
	- You wouldn't get it
	- You wouldn't get it
	- You wouldn't get it
	Whitney: Ah... Maybe more luck next time? [speed=1.5][font_size=10] Why did I say that, I'm so stupid!
- Actually... Nevermind...
	Whitney: *Sigh* The customer sure is always right!
=> END

